### ============================================
### Nuxt Proxy - HTTP Smoke Tests
### 测试 Nuxt server-side API 代理是否正常转发
### ============================================

### ---------- 推荐/分类（core 转发） ----------
### 推荐视频
GET http://localhost/api/video/random/visitor

### 分类列表
GET http://localhost/api/category/getall

### ---------- 搜索（search 转发） ----------
### 搜索视频
GET http://localhost/api/search/video/only-pass?keyword=test&page=1

### ---------- 登录（core 转发） ----------
### 正确登录
POST http://localhost/api/user/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 错误密码
POST http://localhost/api/user/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
